Package: com.aha.mobile
Name: AHA
Version: 0.5.50
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Maintainer: aha
Author: aha
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 14.0), mobilesubstrate | ellekit
Description: AHA - in-app collection client for the team tenant pool.
 Floating panel inside the Shopee app: configure hub address and tenant
 account, take tasks from your own pool, passively capture the app's own
 product API responses and submit them back. No jailbreak hiding,
 no detection evasion, no response tampering.

